  "configuration_notes": [
    "Workstream is selected per active row from the complete target pair: T.Initial Rejection % plus T.% Of Approval within 48 HR/1.5 HR. The approved pairs are (3%, 75%) and (6%, 75%) for IP Elective, and (1%, 100%) and (3%, 100%) for ER / IP Approval. The turnaround numerator must agree with that pair; both or neither populated, a missing target, or an unsupported pair fails ingestion with employee identifiers instead of guessing.",
    "Rows whose Status or Performance Grade is Leave, New Staff, or - are excluded before scoring. Resigned is not excluded because it was not supplied as a business rule.",
    "The ER source table says within 48 hours in its target header, but its KPI and source numerator are 1.5 hours. The canonical target is 100% within 1.5 hours. Row-level target values are preserved to support historical target revisions in the source workbook.",
    "The product scorecard caps each KPI achievement and final score at 100%; presentation and stored scoring use the same cap."
  ],
  "performance_levels": {
